# hw-isp round 7 (Aperture 0005): the camera app mirrors the preview of whichever camera faces the user, which depends
# on the screen in use (a6l_dualux: vendor.dualux.state = lcd | eink | eink-asleep). vendor_dualux_prop is a
# vendor_restricted_prop (eink/switcher/sepolicy/vendor/property.te): coredomain may read it when allowed.
# Aperture runs as untrusted_app_34 (product app, not privileged); appdomain covers it and any other camera app.
get_prop(appdomain, vendor_dualux_prop)
